# The other half of the raid system: running dark, and killing the record before
# it travels (docs/VISION.md §9.2, §9.3). A holding built out of the pieces that
# say nothing, the one comfort that gives it away, a clerk that reads it, that
# reading taken off the body — and then nothing comes, because nothing was ever
# filed.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/raids-dark.tour --seed=7 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0 \
#     --held=axe_felling \
#     --give=driftwood:8,rag:6,deadwood:8,stone:8,timber:6,reeds:8
#
# No --attention: this one starts where a player starts, at nothing, and the
# whole proof is that it is still at nothing at the end.
zoom 10
coast calm
place spawn
wait 0.4
walk -1,1 1.6
wait 0.5
# A roof and a plot. Both are SILENT on purpose (StructureKind.SIGNS): a place
# can be lived in without being found, and that is the decision this tour makes.
tap holding
await app:holding 4
choose build_lean_to
tap use
await made 8
wait 0.4
choose build_plot
tap use
await made 8
wait 0.6
# The same seven bars the machines read, with nothing on them. Nothing has ever
# been filed about this place and nothing is carrying anything away from it.
await unfiled 4
shot 01-nothing-to-hear with app:holding, holding
# And then the one comfort: a hearth is smoke by day and light by night, and it
# is the first thing about this place a machine can hear.
choose build_hearth
tap use
await made 8
wait 0.6
shot 02-the-hearth-is-the-mistake with app:holding, holding
tap pause
wait 0.8
# A watcher on the ground beside it reads what the page just said. From here the
# reading is a thing in the world, and the player has until it gets clear of the
# yard — which for a watcher is a long, slow walk.
spawn watcher
await noticed 12
shot 03-a-watcher-reads-the-hearth with mob:watcher, holding, station:fire
# Take it off the body before it travels. Its working part is its lens, which is
# the side it is reading you with.
try 25
walkto part 1.4
tap swing
await hit 1.4
end
try 25
walkto part 1.2
tap swing
await killed 1.6
end
await stopped 8
await record 8
# Back to the fire it was reading, with the record in the creel.
near fire
wait 0.8
shot 04-the-record-off-the-body with holding, station:fire
# Night, and nothing comes: the plan has nothing on this place, so there is no
# step for it to be due. That is what running dark buys, said as a state of the
# world rather than as a thing that failed to happen.
hour 23
wait 2.0
await unfiled 8
await nothing_coming 8
shot 05-nothing-is-coming with holding, station:fire
